    "selectedTakeDetails": [
      {
        "id": "01-problem-1",
        "text": "给你六座城市的相连关系，直接或间接相连的城市算一个省份。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "ec395cd60f63e726c16a51967792c60580f14f05a6880736ab0eb8485e0fd455",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.5268333333333333,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.53,
        "keptSamples": 234024,
        "sourceSamples": 273928,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9990867938112392
      },
      {
        "id": "01-problem-2",
        "text": "要数一共几个省份；即使没有任何连接，一座城市自己也算一个。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "a20f2bb4e65ef963544eb3cac6b732d22ac9f94ad5998b8761c26d0e3877fa87",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.4232916666666666,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.42,
        "keptSamples": 295064,
        "sourceSamples": 329918,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9982587108062416
      },
      {
        "id": "02-indirect-1",
        "text": "看主例，A连B、B连C，D连E，F独立。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "285b134aa58a28f1b16499e2c6b96ffa3a3e9f51386058b13f937e4806bc505a",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.4857083333333332,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.49,
        "keptSamples": 233678,
        "sourceSamples": 271474,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9995576220891974
      },
      {
        "id": "02-indirect-2",
        "text": "A和C没有直接相连，却能经过B连通，所以这六座城市分成三组。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "a6215ebf569e3fc1f0215625d5f28e899c688fd15d2fef578d8c4af4ee03ab2c",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.5034999999999998,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.5,
        "keptSamples": 324406,
        "sourceSamples": 363048,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9997997549831373
      },
      {
        "id": "03-derive-groups-1",
        "text": "接着想怎么做：我们只关心城市分成了几组，不必保存每条中间路线。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "aec1212e273f05e24670d631d7b41c944e33dffd15b91a66747d6e12f99b8f33",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.417416666666667,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.42,
        "keptSamples": 259684,
        "sourceSamples": 294596,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9995934470548555
      },
      {
        "id": "03-derive-groups-2",
        "text": "每看到一对相连城市，若已经同组就不变，只有跨组时才把两组并成一组。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "22b172db6adcd28ceeca30833663ce43f4a1435f7b6eea5ae18da594f0a9ad02",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.4259166666666667,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.43,
        "keptSamples": 299674,
        "sourceSamples": 334844,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9966578011485608
      },
      {
        "id": "04-representative-1",
        "text": "给组一个代表，同组城市只要找到同一个代表，就能判断彼此已经连通。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "c712d6f629468789e22bac27334855e1375d87de759fd959b97a86d46ad25be4",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.3680000000000003,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.37,
        "keptSamples": 275970,
        "sourceSamples": 308064,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9936916747186753
      },
      {
        "id": "04-representative-2",
        "text": "开始还没处理相连关系，六座城市各自成组，因此最初有六个代表。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "3e127cc79291f908e5e6f848f5802924dacd54b4aeffe4117b4e0865b0e3c038",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.47904166666666637,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.48,
        "keptSamples": 279372,
        "sourceSamples": 317234,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9989045492715823
      },
      {
        "id": "05-parent-1",
        "text": "接下来把这个想法存下来：每个城市记录上一级，沿记录找，直到指向自己。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "e117bc9a047207f36c3aeea987b217b8f5de68c94bc4560b7d955a48e8cd0453",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.39187500000000064,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.39,
        "keptSamples": 297930,
        "sourceSamples": 331290,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.998446540266247
      },
      {
        "id": "05-parent-2",
        "text": "这个停下的位置就是根，也就是组代表；这些箭头只是归属记录，不是新连接。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "750f77f12edbf1f6223b859436d52a954cb0463d572c5933ed8c153d153d087d",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.39408333333333356,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.39,
        "keptSamples": 333724,
        "sourceSamples": 367396,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.997335293189891
      },
      {
        "id": "06-name-1",
        "text": "遇到跨组连接，先分别找到两边的根，再把一个根接到另一个根下面。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "404a2141826f9c34eacaf87da25e9bdb9aaccfe4662b70293d45b3e4009c441a",
        "rawToWAVPCMExact": true,
        "actualSharedCutTailSeconds": 0.3414999999999999,
        "reportedTailCutSeconds": 0.34,
        "keptSamples": 256574,
        "sourceSamples": 287592,
        "sentencePCMEqualsWholeTrackSlice": true,
        "sourceCutVsNormalizedSentenceCorrelation": 0.9990149889945014
      },
      {
        "id": "06-name-2",
        "text": "并查集就是这样查询同组、合并两组；根不相同才合并，省份数才减一。",
        "selectedWAVsha256": "f8c5980f5b546b665f1a9de62324c227dab59bb1c0d283987a939182afab9ffc",
